@startuml store-analytics
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #555
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #888
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

title Store Analytics: Track sự kiện + xem thống kê

actor Customer
actor "Store Owner" as Owner
participant "StoreVisitTracker\n(.tsx)" as Tracker
participant "StoreMonitorTab\n(.tsx)" as MonitorUI
participant "StoreAnalytics\nController" as API
participant "StoreAnalytics\nService" as Svc
participant "QrService" as QrSvc
database "store_analytics_events\n(Postgres)" as DB

== 1. Track lượt ghé trang store ==

Customer -> Tracker : vào /stores/{id}
Tracker -> API : POST /public/analytics/track\nbody: { storeId, eventType: 'store_visit' }
API -> Svc : track(storeId, 'store_visit')

note right of Svc : fire-and-forget\n(không await)

Svc -> DB : INSERT (storeId, eventType, createdAt)
API --> Tracker : 200 { ok: true }

== 2. Track quét QR (hook vào QrService) ==

note over QrSvc, Svc
  Trong QrService.resolveTokenData():
  sau khi xác nhận store hợp lệ
end note

QrSvc -> Svc : track(storeId, 'qr_scan')
Svc -> DB : INSERT event

== 3. Store owner xem thống kê ==

Owner -> MonitorUI : mở tab "Thống kê"
MonitorUI -> API : GET /store-owner/stores/{id}/analytics
API -> Svc : getAnalytics(storeId, ownerId)

Svc -> DB : verify ownership (find store WHERE id AND ownerId)
DB --> Svc : store

Svc -> DB : Promise.all([\n  total counts (group by eventType),\n  today counts,\n  this week counts,\n  daily 14 ngày\n])
DB --> Svc : aggregated rows

Svc -> Svc : zero-fill 14 ngày + format
Svc --> API : { qrScans, storeVisits, reviews, daily }
API --> MonitorUI : data
MonitorUI --> Owner : StatCards + MiniBarChart

@enduml
